(R/'docs/handoffs/L36-v2-contracts-review.md').write_text(f'''# L36 v2 independent review frozen\n\nAll 11 current items verified, zero flags or key disagreements. All 74 accepted objects and hashes preserved, giving 85 matching accepted reviews. Eight repairs disclose prior exposure; three new gap questions were freshly blind solved. Nineteen citation pages were re-inspected, backed by the earlier complete 39-page source inspection. Independent checks: 17 explicit assertions and 1,000 varied metric cases. All three bounded gaps are closed.\n\nTwo older search-slice quality concerns remain separately documented; this is not a blanket quality-release claim.\n\nReview: {path}\nSHA256: {sha(path)}\nSummary: audits/W08-L36-v2-contracts-review-summary.json\nCoverage: audits/W08-L36-v2-contracts-coverage-challenge.json\nFrozen answers: {ap}\nSHA256: {sha(ap)}\n\nIsolated validation: {len(v['errors'])} errors, {len(v['warnings'])} warnings. No author, bank, source or Git edits. Next: L35 v3 seven items, L34 v3 three, L37 v3 twelve, then fresh L42. Do not rerun frozen scripts against changed objects.\n''')
